/// [bounds[e], bounds[e+1]) of `xq` (bounds on the device, n+1 entries) times its [w_rows, w_cols] matrix into
/// dst rows of the same indices (`ld_dst` floats apart, via `ids`: dst row = ids[row], an identity table works).
